WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:11.067
Procurement is everything you buy for the job, from order to payment.

2
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:28.603
Press New PO to raise a purchase order. Choose the vendor and order date, then add each item with its quantity, rate before tax, HSN code and GST. Transport and loading charges go at the bottom.

3
00:00:28.603 --> 00:00:37.790
When the material arrives, record it under Goods Receipt against its purchase order. The stock goes up by what actually came.

4
00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:49.384
Under Bills, each vendor bill is matched to its order. Scan Invoice reads a photo or PDF of a GST invoice and matches it to your PO for you.

5
00:00:49.384 --> 00:00:56.045
The Ledger shows what you owe each vendor and what you've paid, and Vendors lists everyone you buy from.
